     1	## Deep Normative Tractometry for Identifying Joint White Matter Macro- and Micro-structural Abnormalities in Alzheimer's Disease
     2	
     3	Yixue Feng ∗ , Bramsh Q. Chandio ∗ , Julio E. Villalon-Reina ∗ , Sebastian Benavidez ∗ , Tamoghna Chattopadhyay ∗ , Sasha Chehrzadeh ∗ , Emily Laltoo ∗ , Sophia I. Thomopoulos ∗ , Himanshu Joshi † , † † ∗ ∗
